          %h2#Rules Rules
          %p These rules are not the final rules that are planned to be implemented in proto CLF. The major differences planned for the final rules from those here are:
          %ul
            %li Use roughly Nuprl-style hidden assumptions, but with unhiding handled automatically.
            %li Have an additional judgment form for goals whose realizer is ignored/arbitrary, which interacts with unhiding.
            %li Add formal proof terms.
          %p The expectation and hope is that the result will look fairly similar to algorithmic elaboration-style type checking rules. These rules will be the primitive tactics, and type checking will thus be a special case of running tactic trees.
          %h3#type_formation Type Formation
